# Monorepo architecture

- Product apps live under `apps/<name>` (`:apps:<name>`).
- Shared MVVM/UI/utils live under `core/*`. **No product features in `core`.**
- Dependency flow: `apps/*` → `core/*` and `apps/*` → `data`/`domain`. Never `core` → `apps`.
- `domain` is pure Kotlin. UI is Compose-only. State via StateFlow; ViewModels extend `core:mvvm` `BaseViewModel`.
- New app: create `apps/<name>`, `include(":apps:<name>")`, depend on needed `core` modules.
